# /etc/conf/modreg.d/z3660scsi -- the z3660scsi module package's defaults
# (amix-dlm C3-5 sec 1): one `param <name>=<value>` per default other than
# the module's own, `disable` to ship it off.  None: the package ships the
# module's own default cache=-1, the data-cache arm from the CPU type (0 on
# a 68030, 40 on a 68040, 60 on a 68060).  Local settings belong in
